  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;Continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>By using eq. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
